# Agency Discovery Call Scorecard — Rubric {{ rubric_version }} for {{ company_name }}

## Version
- rubric_version: {{ rubric_version }}
- version_date: {{ version_date }}
- version_reason: {{ version_reason }} (anchors and weights change only through a new version)

## Axes (fit, budget, urgency, decision_maker; weights to two decimals, sum 1.0, none above 0.5; anchors lowest to highest, each a fact quotable from the call)

| name | weight | anchor 0 (lowest) | anchor 1 | anchor 2 (highest) |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| fit | 0.3 | outside ICP: none of industry, size or service line match | meets 1-2 of 3 ICP criteria | meets all 3 ICP criteria and asks for our core service line |
| budget | 0.3 | no budget named or under {{ budget_floor }} {{ currency }} per year | {{ budget_floor }}-{{ budget_ceiling }} {{ currency }} per year stated on the call | above {{ budget_ceiling }} {{ currency }} per year stated on the call |
| urgency | 0.2 | no date; browsing | start this quarter | start this month or a named deadline within 30 days |
| decision_maker | 0.2 | authority not discussed, or an individual contributor | manager who must get sign-off from a named person | owner, partner or director who confirmed they approve the spend |

## Scoring
- score_range: 0-100
- formula: sum(weight * anchor_index / (anchor_count - 1)) * 100
- decision_threshold: {{ decision_threshold }} (one number strictly inside the range)
- threshold_rule: score at or above decision_threshold advances; below is rejected or nurtured

## Retro
- cadence: weekly
- same_version_only: true
- compares: advance_rate, close_rate_of_advanced (against the previous period, same rubric version)

## Scored call (one block per call, filled within 24 hours by someone who was on it)
- lead: <company>
- call_date / scored_at: <ISO timestamps, scored_at within 24 hours>
- scorer_on_call: true
- rubric_version: {{ rubric_version }}

| axis | anchor_index | evidence (quote or paraphrase from the call) | authority_confirmed (decision_maker only) |
|---|---|---|---|
| fit | <0-2> | <which ICP criteria were met> | |
| budget | <0-2> | <the amount the prospect stated> | |
| urgency | <0-2> | <the date or window the prospect named> | |
| decision_maker | <0-2; 0 if authority was not discussed> | <who was on the call and what sign-off they confirmed> | <true / false> |

- score: <formula result>
- decision: <advance if score >= threshold, else reject or nurture>
